# "ĉiu" (every, each): en.wiktionary.org "ĉiu", worked example "Ĉiu tago
# daŭras dudek kvar horojn" (Each day lasts 24 hours).  "ĉiun" is the
# regular accusative of the same determiner, taken by the periphrasis
# "ĉiun UNITn" ("ĉiun tagon" -- every day) exactly as the counted noun
# itself takes -n (see unit1_*.voc): the temporal-accusative idiom already
# attested for single occurrences (weekday_0.voc) extended to the
# distributive determiner, standard Esperanto adjective-noun case
# agreement (en.wikipedia.org "Esperanto grammar", accusative case).
ĉiu
ĉiun
